===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂ews-|id=dawn}}
From {{inh|en|enm|est}}, from {{inh|en|ang|ēast}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*austr}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*austrą}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*h₂ewsér|t=east}}. Compare {{cog|fy|east}}, {{cog|nl|oost}}, {{cog|de|Ost}}, {{cog|da|øst}}, {{cog|nn|aust}}, {{cog|sv|öst}}.

